{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13208170","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13208170","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1320817001:1":{"text":"ここんとこ大雪が続いてるからな。獣が洞窟に入ってくることがあるかもしれん。","source_cn":"嚯嚯，朋友，最近风雪很大，会有野兽来洞内取暖歇息。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAA3035BD3FC804D6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1320817002:1":{"text":"帰る時は気を付けろよ。それから、交代の者に武器を用意しておくよう伝えておいてくれ。","source_cn":"你回家时注意些，让之后换班来采集的人配好武器，保障安全。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5F0BDE423587CD6F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1320817003:1":{"text":"え？わざわざそれを言うために戻って来たのか？","source_cn":"什么？你们是特意赶回来的？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4CCE774611F6561F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1320817004:1":{"text":"分かったよ。採掘した鉱石を精錬所に運んだら、オレも帰る支度をするつもりだ。","source_cn":"我也准备收工了，等把开凿出来的矿石运到冶炼处，我就回家。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x22B02F908443E2D2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1320817005:1":{"text":"そんじゃ、またな！","source_cn":"再见，朋友们！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2834D5BF973F7985","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1320817006:1":{"text":"真面目で責任感が強く、最後まで仕事を全うするのがドワーフだ。","source_cn":"我的同胞如此认真负责，坚守到最后一刻。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3E217825E1D22D06","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1320817007:1":{"text":"さて、彫像の製作過程を見学したいんだったな。ここで氷を採掘するチームの他に、街で氷像を支える金属フレームを製作するチームもいるんだ。精錬から鋳造まで、すべて同胞たちが手がけているぞ。","source_cn":"好了，你们之前说想参观雕像制作的全流程。一队工匠开凿冰...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2A6215FAF62B4433","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1320817008:1":{"text":"こっちだ。ワシらもそろそろ<style=\"highlight\">スノーシダー町</style>へ戻るぞ！","source_cn":"——跟我来，我们也该回<style=highlight...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5769A4C6CF6368CC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:呼金":{"text":"フーキン","source":"呼金","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:大嗓门矿工":{"text":"声が大きい鉱山員","source":"大嗓门矿工","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":9,"localized_text_count":8,"speaker_count":2}}